OL,3,GNEWSAKilled baby's funeral 'important
OL,4,Amoment' for family
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe funeral of a newborn baby who was
OL,7,Fstabbed to death has been described by
OL,8,Fa parish priest as "an important
OL,9,Fmoment" for the family as they try to
OL,10,Frebuild their lives.
OL,12,FMaria Skopova was found dead at a house
OL,13,Fin Holywell Heights, Sheffield, on 30
OL,14,FAugust, the day she was born, having
OL,15,Fsuffered 33 wounds.
OL,17,FHer mother, Andrea Skopova, 20, along
OL,18,Fwith Peter Horvath, 19, Peter Horvath,
OL,19,F38, and Nina Horvathova, 37, have all
OL,20,Fbeen charged with murder, while a
OL,21,F15-year-old girl has been charged with
OL,22,Fperverting the course of justice.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
