OL,3,GNEWSAKilled baby's funeral 'important
OL,4,Amoment' for family
OL,5,
OL,6,FRev Fr Chris Posluszny, who led the
OL,7,Fservice at St Marie's Cathedral on
OL,8,FMonday, said the infant's death had
OL,9,F"affected the family so hard".
